# KaTeX is a re-fetchable dependency, not prototype source: the whole vendor
# tree is 596 KB and 20 woff2 fonts. Restore with:
#   npm i katex && cp node_modules/katex/dist/katex.min.{js,css} prototype/vendor/katex/
#   cp node_modules/katex/dist/fonts/*.woff2 prototype/vendor/katex/fonts/
# then strip the ttf/woff url() alternatives from katex.min.css (see the report).
katex/
